{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22924","headline":"浔阳岁晚寄元八郎中庾三十二员外 · 白居易","name":"浔阳岁晚寄元八郎中庾三十二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阅水年将暮，烧金道未成。\n丹砂不肯死，白发自须生。\n病肺慙杯满，衰颜忌镜明。\n春深旧乡梦，岁晚故交情。\n一别浮云散，双瞻列宿荣。\n螭头阶下立，龙尾道前行。\n封事频闻奏，除书数见名。\n虚怀事僚友，平步取公卿。\n漏尽鸡人报，朝回幼女迎。\n可怜白司马，老大在湓城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}